 كل المناطق","rental_id":232130,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z"},{"id":5869227,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":232130,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z"},{"id":5901437,"review":"شقة مريحة ونظيفة","rental_id":232130,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z"},{"id":5917703,"review":"Perfect location and very clean place will recommend recommended to everyone","rental_id":232130,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z"},{"id":6004397,"review":"This place was okay. Price was cheap and it provided a space to live in and get to easily.\nIt did come with lots of inconveniences:\n1) Lock code hadn't been provided prior to arrival. Had to wait about 20-30 mins to get it sent and enter. \n2) Shower head was leaking in en suite, so hot water and pressure was limited. They replaced it after a day.\n3) Soap, shampoo and conditioner dispensers only had one working spout between them (en suite). So was told to swap that spout between liquids. Not fixed.\n4) TV and one AC remote batteries either dead or not there. They changed them after a few hours/next day.\n\nYou had to be at the flat for all the fixes, if you didn't want them to enter when you were out.\n\nBeds were comfortable. Bedrooms spacious. \n\nSofa in living room was very stained. \nOnly a tiny tabletop ironing board.\n\nNot likely to stay again.","rental_id":232130,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z"},{"id":6113534,"review":"كان مميز و اصبح عادي جدا","rental_id":232130,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:28.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:28.000000Z"},{"id":6124073,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":232130,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}